{
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposal would be unacceptable in principle as the property is not an appropriate size to be considered suitable for conversion, resulting in the loss of family sized dwellings, contrary Local Plan policy SC6 (Managing building conversions and sub-division of existing housing stock).",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposal, by reason of inadequate internal space provision and failure to demonstrate acceptable amenity space provision would result in poor living conditions for future occupiers of this development. The proposal is therefore contrary to London Plan policies D4 (Delivering good design), D5 (Inclusive Design) and D6 (Housing quality and standards) and Local Plan policies SC3 (Meeting the need for a mix of housing size and type), SC4 (Scale and density of new housing development) and SC5 (Ensuring suitable internal and external space).",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposal does not demonstrate that the environmental performance of the building has been maximised. The proposal is therefore contrary to London Plan policies SI2 (Minimising greenhouse gas emissions), SI3 (Energy infrastructure) and SI4 (Managing heat risk) and Local Plan policies EQ1 (Energy and carbon reduction) and EQ2 (Sustainable design and construction)."
  ],
